OL,3,GNEWSAHow major policy shift is changing
OL,4,Apolice response to mental health
OL,5,Acall-outs
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhile reaction to the policy has been
OL,8,Fmixed, the PSNI says it is about
OL,9,Fensuring individuals receive care from
OL,10,Fthe most appropriate professional or
OL,11,Fservice.
